        "children": [],
        "answer": {
          "short": "$x=6$",
          "worked": "By Pythagoras’ theorem,\n$$\\begin{align*}x^2+(x+2)^2&=10^2\\\\2x^2+4x+4&=100\\\\x^2+2x-48&=0\\\\(x+8)(x-6)&=0\\\\x&=-8\\text{ or }6.\\end{align*}$$\nSince $x>0$, $x=6$.",
          "solutionDiagrams": []
        },
        "answerSpaceMm": 62,
        "responseSpace": "scaffold"
      },
      {
        "id": "p14-q6-b",
        "type": "part",
